  "title": "Individual Turkey Pot Pies",
  "description": "These mini turkey pot pies can be topped any way you like — puff pastry, pie crust, or mashed potatoes — and make the most of your leftover turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "College Inn Broths and Stocks"
  ],
